### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Register a user
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Log in (copy accessToken into the @token variable above)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Create a product
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "price": 49.90,
  "stock": 10
}

### Get a product (no token needed)
GET {{host}}/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Create an order
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Same key, same body: replays the order, stock must not drop again
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Same key, different body: 422
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 5 }
  ]
}

### Missing Idempotency-Key: 400
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Get an order
GET {{host}}/orders/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pay for an order
POST {{host}}/orders/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel an order
POST {{host}}/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}